---
import PublicLayout from '../layouts/PublicLayout.astro';
---
<PublicLayout title="EduLibre — Toda la oferta académica de Venezuela, en un solo lugar" description="Universidades, institutos, academias y cursos cortos de toda Venezuela en un solo lugar. Gratis para estudiantes, para siempre." navVariant="full">
<section class="hero">
<div class="wrap">
<span class="hero__eyebrow">Sin colas · sin OPSU caído · sin 40 grupos de WhatsApp</span>
<h1>¿Y ahora qué estudio?</h1>
<p class="hero__sub">EduLibre reúne universidades, institutos y cursos de toda Venezuela públicos y privados en un solo buscador. Gratis para siempre si eres estudiante.</p>
<form action="/results" class="searchbar" method="GET">
<div class="searchbar__field" style="flex: 2; padding-right: 0;">
<input aria-label="Qué quieres estudiar" name="query" placeholder="¿Qué quieres estudiar?" type="text" style="padding-right: 0;"/>
<button type="submit" style="background:none; border:none; color:var(--muted); cursor:pointer; padding:0 16px;">
<link rel="icon" type="image/svg+xml" href="/favicon.svg" />
<svg class="searchbar__icon" fill="none" height="16" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="16"><circle cx="11" cy="11" r="7"></circle><path d="m21 21-4.3-4.3"></path></svg>
</button>
</div>
</form>
<div class="chips">
<span class="chip">Medicina</span><span class="chip">Derecho</span>
<span class="chip">Ingeniería en Sistemas</span><span class="chip">Psicología</span>
<span class="chip">Cursos de inglés</span>
</div>
</div>
<svg class="torn" preserveAspectRatio="none" viewBox="0 0 1200 60"><path d="M0,40 L40,30 L80,45 L120,25 L160,42 L200,28 L240,44 L280,30 L320,40 L360,26 L400,44 L440,32 L480,42 L520,28 L560,40 L600,30 L640,44 L680,28 L720,40 L760,32 L800,44 L840,26 L880,42 L920,30 L960,40 L1000,28 L1040,44 L1080,30 L1120,42 L1160,28 L1200,40 L1200,60 L0,60 Z" fill="#F6F7FA"></path></svg>
</section>
<section style="padding:0;">
<div class="wrap">
<div class="trust">
<div class="grid-4">
<div class="stat-card"><span class="num">24 estados</span><span class="label">Cobertura nacional</span></div>
<div class="stat-card"><span class="num">Público y privado</span><span class="label">Todos los sectores</span></div>
<div class="stat-card"><span class="num">100% gratis</span><span class="label">Para estudiantes, para siempre</span></div>
<div class="stat-card"><span class="num">Curado a mano</span><span class="label">Revisado por el equipo</span></div>
</div>
</div>
</div>
</section>
<section class="cats reveal" id="categorias">
<div class="wrap">
<span class="eyebrow">Explora por categoría</span>
<h2>Toda la oferta académica del país, ordenada</h2>
<div class="catgrid">
<a class="catcard" href="/area?area=ingenieria"><svg fill="none" stroke="#F0DDBB" stroke-width="1.6" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="3"></circle><path d="M19.4 15a1.7 1.7 0 0 0 .3 1.9l.1.1a2 2 0 1 1-2.8 2.8l-.1-.1a1.7 1.7 0 0 0-1.9-.3 1.7 1.7 0 0 0-1 1.5V21a2 2 0 1 1-4 0v-.1a1.7 1.7 0 0 0-1-1.6 1.7 1.7 0 0 0-1.9.3l-.1.1a2 2 0 1 1-2.8-2.8l.1-.1a1.7 1.7 0 0 0 .3-1.9 1.7 1.7 0 0 0-1.5-1H3a2 2 0 1 1 0-4h.1a1.7 1.7 0 0 0 1.6-1 1.7 1.7 0 0 0-.3-1.9l-.1-.1a2 2 0 1 1 2.8-2.8l.1.1a1.7 1.7 0 0 0 1.9.3H9a1.7 1.7 0 0 0 1-1.5V3a2 2 0 1 1 4 0v.1a1.7 1.7 0 0 0 1 1.5 1.7 1.7 0 0 0 1.9-.3l.1-.1a2 2 0 1 1 2.8 2.8l-.1.1a1.7 1.7 0 0 0-.3 1.9V9a1.7 1.7 0 0 0 1.5 1H21a2 2 0 1 1 0 4h-.1a1.7 1.7 0 0 0-1.5 1Z"></path></svg><div><h3>Ingeniería y Tecnología</h3><p>Civil, Sistemas, Petróleo, Computación y más.</p></div></a>
<a class="catcard" href="/area?area=salud"><svg fill="none" stroke="#F0DDBB" stroke-width="1.6" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M20.8 4.6a5.5 5.5 0 0 0-7.8 0L12 5.6l-1-1a5.5 5.5 0 1 0-7.8 7.8l1 1L12 21l7.8-7.6 1-1a5.5 5.5 0 0 0 0-7.8Z"></path></svg><div><h3>Ciencias de la Salud</h3><p>Medicina, Enfermería, Fisioterapia, Odontología.</p></div></a>
<a class="catcard" href="/area?area=economia"><svg fill="none" stroke="#F0DDBB" stroke-width="1.6" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M3 3v18h18"></path><path d="M7 15l4-5 3 3 5-7"></path></svg><div><h3>Económicas y Sociales</h3><p>Administración, Comercio, Contaduría Pública.</p></div></a>
<a class="catcard" href="/area?area=humanidades"><svg fill="none" stroke="#F0DDBB" stroke-width="1.6" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M12 3 1 8l11 5 9-4.1V15h1V8L12 3Z"></path><path d="M5 10.5V16c0 1.7 3.1 3 7 3s7-1.3 7-3v-5.5"></path></svg><div><h3>Humanidades y Educación</h3><p>Educación, Psicología, Idiomas Modernos.</p></div></a>
<a class="catcard" href="/area?area=derecho"><svg fill="none" stroke="#F0DDBB" stroke-width="1.6" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M12 3v18M5 8l7-5 7 5M4 21h16M6 21V9M18 21V9"></path></svg><div><h3>Jurídicas y Políticas</h3><p>Derecho, Ciencias Políticas, Estudios Internacionales.</p></div></a>
<a class="catcard" href="/area?area=agro"><svg fill="none" stroke="#F0DDBB" stroke-width="1.6" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M12 2c2 3 3 5 3 8a3 3 0 1 1-6 0c0-3 1-5 3-8Z"></path><path d="M5 14c1.5 2 3 3 3 5a2 2 0 1 1-4 0c0-2 .5-3 1-5ZM19 14c-1.5 2-3 3-3 5a2 2 0 1 0 4 0c0-2-.5-3-1-5Z"></path></svg><div><h3>Ciencias del Agro y el Mar</h3><p>Agronomía, Veterinaria, Ingeniería Pesquera.</p></div></a>
<a class="catcard" href="/area?area=artes"><svg fill="none" stroke="#F0DDBB" stroke-width="1.6" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><rect height="14" rx="1.5" width="18" x="3" y="5"></rect><path d="M3 9h18"></path></svg><div><h3>Artes y Arquitectura</h3><p>Arquitectura, Música, Diseño, Artes Audiovisuales.</p></div></a>
<a class="catcard" href="/area?area=cursos"><svg fill="none" stroke="#F0DDBB" stroke-width="1.6" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><circle cx="12" cy="8" r="5"></circle><path d="m8.5 12.5-1.7 7 5.2-2.6 5.2 2.6-1.7-7"></path></svg><div><h3>Cursos y Certificaciones</h3><p>Cursos cortos, online o presenciales.</p></div></a>
</div>
</div>
</section>
<section class="inst reveal" id="instituciones">
<div class="wrap">
<span class="eyebrow">Para instituciones</span>
<h2>Sé una de las primeras en aparecer aquí</h2>
<p class="lead">Estamos construyendo el catálogo con instituciones reales, una por una nada de logos de relleno. Si la tuya todavía no está, regístrala gratis durante el lanzamiento.</p>
<div class="emptygrid">
<div class="empty-state" style="padding:26px 12px;"><svg fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.6" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M12 5v14M5 12h14"></path></svg><span class="mono" style="font-size:12.5px;">Tu institución aquí</span></div>
<div class="empty-state" style="padding:26px 12px;"><svg fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.6" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M12 5v14M5 12h14"></path></svg><span class="mono" style="font-size:12.5px;">Tu institución aquí</span></div>
<div class="empty-state" style="padding:26px 12px;"><svg fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.6" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M12 5v14M5 12h14"></path></svg><span class="mono" style="font-size:12.5px;">Tu institución aquí</span></div>
<a class="empty-state emptyslot--cta" href="/registro-institucion" style="padding:26px 12px;"><svg fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M5 12h14M13 6l6 6-6 6"></path></svg><span class="mono" style="font-size:12.5px;">Regístrate gratis</span></a>
</div>
<div class="inst-banner">
<div>
<h3>Publica tu oferta académica gratis</h3>
<p>Sin comisiones ni letra pequeña durante el lanzamiento. Llega a bachilleres que buscan exactamente lo que ofreces.</p>
</div>
<a class="btn btn--stamp" href="/registro-institucion">Registrar mi institución</a>
</div>
</div>
</section>
<section class="trust-close reveal">
<div class="wrap">
<h2>Hecho para bachilleres, no para trámites.</h2>
<p>Buscar, filtrar y postularte en EduLibre será gratis para siempre. Nada de costos escondidos ni de esperar a que un sistema colapse justo cuando más lo necesitas.</p>
<a class="btn btn--solid" href="/results">Buscar mi carrera</a>
</div>
</section>
</PublicLayout>

<script>
  function updateHomeNav() {
    console.debug('[Nav] updateHomeNav start', { readyState: document.readyState });
    const token = localStorage.getItem('auth_token');
    const role = localStorage.getItem('role');
    const navActions = document.querySelector('.nav__actions');
    if (!navActions) {
      console.debug('[Nav] navActions not found');
      return;
    }

    if (token && role) {
      console.debug('[Nav] authenticated user detected', { role });
      let accountUrl = '/';
      if (role === 'STUDENT') accountUrl = '/estudiante/panel';
      if (role === 'INSTITUTION') accountUrl = '/institucion/dashboard';
      if (role === 'ADMIN') accountUrl = '/admin/dashboard';

      navActions.innerHTML = `
        <a href="${accountUrl}" class="btn btn--solid">Mi cuenta</a>
        <button type="button" id="logout-btn" class="btn btn--ghost">Cerrar sesión</button>
      `;

      document.getElementById('logout-btn')?.addEventListener('click', () => {
        console.debug('[Nav] logout clicked');
        localStorage.removeItem('auth_token');
        localStorage.removeItem('role');
        try { localStorage.removeItem('user_session'); } catch(e){}
        console.debug('[Nav] cleared local storage, reloading');
        window.location.reload();
      });
    } else {
      console.debug('[Nav] no authenticated user');
    }
  }

  if (document.readyState === 'loading') {
    document.addEventListener('DOMContentLoaded', () => { console.debug('[Nav] DOMContentLoaded'); updateHomeNav(); });
  } else {
    console.debug('[Nav] document already loaded');
    updateHomeNav();
  }

  window.addEventListener('pageshow', (ev) => { console.debug('[Nav] pageshow event', { persisted: ev.persisted }); updateHomeNav(); });

  // Lógica para alternar el panel de filtros
  const filtersToggle = document.getElementById('filtersToggle');
  const filterPanel = document.getElementById('filterPanel');

  if (filtersToggle && filterPanel) {
    filtersToggle.addEventListener('click', () => {
      const isExpanded = filtersToggle.getAttribute('aria-expanded') === 'true';
      filtersToggle.setAttribute('aria-expanded', !isExpanded);
      filterPanel.classList.toggle('open');
    });
  }

</script>

<style>

  section{padding:96px 0;}
  .hero{position:relative;padding:76px 0 150px;overflow:hidden;
    background:repeating-radial-gradient(circle at 0 0, rgba(255,255,255,.035) 0, rgba(255,255,255,.035) 1px, transparent 1px, transparent 6px),
               linear-gradient(160deg, var(--cork) 0%, var(--cork-dark) 100%);}
  .hero__eyebrow{font-family:'IBM Plex Mono',monospace;font-size:12.5px;font-weight:600;letter-spacing:.1em;color:#F0DDBB;text-transform:uppercase;margin-bottom:20px;display:inline-block;}
  .hero h1{color:#fff;font-size:clamp(36px,5vw,54px);font-weight:900;line-height:1.06;margin-bottom:20px;max-width:640px;}
  .hero__sub{color:#EADFCB;font-size:17.5px;line-height:1.55;max-width:560px;margin-bottom:32px;}
  .searchbar{background:#fff;border-radius:16px;padding:8px;display:flex;gap:0;box-shadow:0 20px 45px rgba(0,0,0,.28);max-width:820px;position:relative;flex-wrap:wrap;}
  .searchbar__field{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:8px;padding:10px 16px;flex:1;min-width:160px;position:relative;}
  .searchbar__field + .searchbar__field{border-left:1px solid #E7E9EF;}
  .searchbar__field input, .searchbar__field select{border:none;background:transparent;font-family:'Inter',sans-serif;font-size:14.5px;color:var(--ink);width:100%;padding:0;}
  .searchbar__field input:focus, .searchbar__field select:focus{outline:none;box-shadow:none;}
  .searchbar__icon{color:var(--muted);font-size:15px;flex-shrink:0;}
  .filters-toggle{background:transparent;border:none;font-size:14.5px;color:var(--ink);font-weight:500;display:flex;align-items:center;gap:8px;padding:8px 12px;border-radius:8px;cursor:pointer;transition:background 0.2s;}
  .filters-toggle:hover{background:#f0f2f5;}
  .filterpanel{display:none;position:absolute;top:calc(100% + 10px);left:0;right:0;background:#fff;border-radius:14px;box-shadow:0 10px 30px rgba(0,0,0,.15);padding:20px;z-index:10;border:1px solid #E7E9EF;}
  .filterpanel.open{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(3,1fr);gap:24px;}
  .filterpanel h4{font-size:12px;font-family:'IBM Plex Mono',monospace;text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:.06em;color:var(--muted);margin-bottom:12px;}
  .filterpanel label{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:10px;font-size:14px;color:var(--ink);margin-bottom:10px;cursor:pointer;white-space:nowrap;}
  .filterpanel label input[type="checkbox"]{width:16px;height:16px;margin:0;cursor:pointer;}
  .chips{display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:9px;margin-top:20px;}
  .chip{font-family:'IBM Plex Mono',monospace;font-size:12.5px;color:#F4EAD5;border:1px solid rgba(244,234,213,.35);border-radius:999px;padding:6px 14px;}
  .torn{position:absolute;left:0;right:0;bottom:-1px;height:60px;z-index:3;}
  .trust{background:#fff;position:relative;z-index:4;margin-top:-72px;border-radius:var(--radius);box-shadow:0 30px 60px rgba(20,33,61,.14);}
  .trust .grid-4{padding:0 8px;}
  .trust .stat-card{border:none;box-shadow:none;border-radius:0;padding:30px 20px;}
  .trust .stat-card + .stat-card{border-left:1px solid #ECEEF3;}
  .cats{padding-top:140px;}
  .cats .wrap{text-align:center;}
  .cats h2{font-size:clamp(28px,3.4vw,38px);max-width:600px;margin:0 auto 56px;}
  .catgrid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(4,1fr);gap:20px;text-align:left;}
  .catcard{background:var(--navy);color:#fff;border-radius:var(--radius);padding:26px 22px;min-height:170px;display:flex;flex-direction:column;justify-content:space-between;transition:transform .18s ease,background .18s ease;}
  .catcard:hover{transform:translateY(-4px);background:var(--blue);}
  .catcard svg{width:26px;height:26px;margin-bottom:16px;}
  .catcard h3{font-size:16px;margin-bottom:6px;}
  .catcard p{font-size:13px;color:#C4D0E8;margin:0;line-height:1.5;}
  .inst{background:var(--paper-dim);}
  .inst .wrap{text-align:center;}
  .inst h2{font-size:clamp(26px,3.2vw,36px);max-width:560px;margin:0 auto 14px;}
  .inst p.lead{color:var(--muted);font-size:16px;max-width:520px;margin:0 auto 40px;line-height:1.6;}
  .emptygrid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(4,1fr);gap:16px;margin-bottom:40px;text-align:center;}
  .emptyslot--cta{border-style:solid;border-color:var(--stamp);color:var(--stamp);background:var(--stamp-bg);}
  .inst-banner{background:var(--navy);border-radius:var(--radius);padding:36px 40px;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;gap:24px;flex-wrap:wrap;text-align:left;}
  .inst-banner p{color:#C4D0E8;font-size:15px;margin:6px 0 0;max-width:420px;}
  .inst-banner h3{color:#fff;font-size:20px;}
  .trust-close .wrap{text-align:center;max-width:640px;}
  .trust-close h2{font-size:clamp(26px,3.4vw,36px);margin-bottom:18px;}
  .trust-close p{color:var(--muted);font-size:16px;line-height:1.65;margin-bottom:30px;}
  @media (max-width:980px){.catgrid{grid-template-columns:repeat(2,1fr);}.emptygrid{grid-template-columns:repeat(2,1fr);}.filterpanel.open{grid-template-columns:1fr;}.trust .grid-4{grid-template-columns:repeat(2,1fr);}.trust .stat-card:nth-child(odd){border-left:none;}}
  @media (max-width:600px){.searchbar{flex-direction:column;}.searchbar__field + .searchbar__field{border-left:none;border-top:1px solid #E7E9EF;}.catgrid{grid-template-columns:1fr;}.emptygrid{grid-template-columns:1fr;}.inst-banner{flex-direction:column;align-items:flex-start;}.trust .grid-4{grid-template-columns:1fr;}.trust .stat-card{border-left:none !important;border-top:1px solid #ECEEF3;}.trust .stat-card:first-child{border-top:none;}}

</style>
